{"id":"n5-117","title":"なにも～ないです (nani mo~nai desu)","jlptLevel":5,"shortExplanation":"Used to express 'not any' or 'nothing' in a negative sentence.","longExplanation":"The なにも～ないです grammar point is used in negative sentences to express the idea of 'not any', 'not at all', 'nothing', or 'none'. It is commonly used with verbs in the negative form.","formation":"なにも + Verb-negative","examples":[{"jp":"彼はなにも言わなかったです。","romaji":"Kare wa nani mo iwanakatta desu.","en":"He didn't say anything.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なに","vocabId":"1577100","reading":"なに"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"言わ","vocabId":"1587040","reading":"いう"},{"surface":"なかっ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"私はなにも食べないです。","romaji":"Watashi wa nani mo tabenai desu.","en":"I don't eat anything.","words":[{"surface":"私","vocabId":"1311110","reading":"わたし"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なに","vocabId":"1577100","reading":"なに"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"食べ","vocabId":"1358280","reading":"たべる"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"彼女はなにも持っていないです。","romaji":"Kanojo wa nani mo motte inai desu.","en":"She doesn't have anything.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なに","vocabId":"1577100","reading":"なに"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"持っ","vocabId":"1315720","reading":"もつ"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"この箱にはなにも入っていないです。","romaji":"Kono hako ni wa nani mo haitte inai desu.","en":"There is nothing in this box.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"箱","vocabId":"1585650","reading":"はこ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なに","vocabId":"1577100","reading":"なに"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"入っ","vocabId":"1465590","reading":"はいる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]}]}